# Making the Grade (windurst 4): Fuepepe, Chomoro-Kyotoro and the school (Windurst Waters), Koru-Moru (Windurst Walls;
# the first of the name, the second is cutscene-only). A level-10 WAR, Teacher's Pet completed by GM, Windurst fame 125
# (level 3: Let Sleeping Dogs Lie, level 4, stays unavailable, so its section-1 child lines do not take turns here).
# NPCs with a script take turns with an Event reply (Moreno-Toeno: 441 / 469 and Teacher's Pet's 439 too; Mashuu-Ajuu:
# Reap What You Sow's random 463; Fuepepe, Pechiru-Mashiru, Koru-Moru: nothing here): talked to twice where it shows.
# Available: the answer sheets traded to Fuepepe (no trade handler: nothing); 442 option 0 (nothing), option 1 (begun).
# Prog 0: Fuepepe 443, Chomoro-Kyotoro 454, the school's 444-453; a chip, the sheets with a chip: nil; the sheets: 455
# (Prog 1; the sheets kept, kept quirk); the sheets again at Prog 1: nil. Prog 1: Fuepepe 456, Chomoro-Kyotoro 457;
# Koru-Moru nil (193); the sheets with a chip: nil; the sheets: 285 (taken; the Tattered Test Sheet; Prog 2); Koru-Moru
# 286. Prog 2: Chomoro-Kyotoro 460 (the test sheet taken, Prog 3), 461. Fuepepe 458 with a full bag (nothing), 458:
# completed (fame 30, the Scroll of Aspir; the mustZone). Completed with the mustZone: no section (nil: 423); out to
# Port Windurst and back: Fuepepe 459 (importantEvent: Progress the first time, then an Event).
lists WindurstWaters/Fuepepe/onTrigger WindurstWaters/Fuepepe/onTrade WindurstWaters/Chomoro-Kyotoro/onTrigger WindurstWaters/Akkeke/onTrigger WindurstWaters/Foi-Mui/onTrigger WindurstWaters/Kirarara/onTrigger WindurstWaters/Koko_Lihzeh/onTrigger WindurstWaters/Mashuu-Ajuu/onTrigger WindurstWaters/Moreno-Toeno/onTrigger WindurstWaters/Paku-Nakku/onTrigger WindurstWaters/Pechiru-Mashiru/onTrigger WindurstWaters/Rukuku/onTrigger WindurstWaters/Tauwawa/onTrigger WindurstWaters/onEventFinish/442 WindurstWaters/onEventFinish/455 WindurstWaters/onEventFinish/458 WindurstWaters/onEventFinish/460 WindurstWalls/Koru-Moru/onTrigger WindurstWalls/Koru-Moru/onTrade WindurstWalls/onEventFinish/285
